{"ancestors": "0,9014636,9015389", "bizKey": "9015390", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-06-28 17:14:56", "detail": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57);\"><strong>题材基本面介绍：</strong></span></p><p><br></p><p>据前瞻产业研究院，2021年中国减速机市场整体规模达1258亿元，其中通用减速机约496.8亿元，占比达39.5%。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/06/25/62837d02-c452-4d0c-967e-c333731ebb8d-1687683559205.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><p>通用减速机的下游应用场景繁多, 行业景气度与宏观经济周期和固定资产投资额密切相关。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/06/25/ba150b0e-75e4-44b8-8350-d76751cb4c64-1687683439302.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><p>市场参与者众多，集中度低。从全球来看，2019年，通用减速机龙头企业SEW和弗兰德的全球市占率仅分别为6.3%、4.1%，全球通用减速机市场CR5仅为16.1%。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/06/25/46361f11-ca11-4f95-a11a-784e2da9f2ec-1687683480984.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><p><br></p>", "firstLetter": "TYJSQ", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "通用减速器", "parentId": 9015389, "pctChg": 1.04, "reason": "通用减速机：用途多、格局散，经济周期相关度高", "remark": "", "sort": 1, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9015390, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-06-28 17:14:56"}
